1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,000
The world stays hidden.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,263
Omnigent agents reach it only through a public HTTP API,

3
00:00:06,263 --> 00:00:08,698
and scoring stays with the host.

4
00:00:09,148 --> 00:00:11,108
Each role owns one decision.

5
00:00:11,108 --> 00:00:15,027
The Theorist fits laws, the Experimentalist ranks tests,

6
00:00:15,027 --> 00:00:17,967
the Operator executes, the Analyst judges,

7
00:00:17,967 --> 00:00:21,607
and the principal investigator decides when to stop.

8
00:00:22,057 --> 00:00:25,440
Predictions must cover every live law before a run.

9
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,691
The server enforces the twelve-experiment budget.

10
00:00:29,141 --> 00:00:32,366
Each verdict feeds the next choice of experiment.

11
00:00:32,366 --> 00:00:34,144
Laws, predictions, results,

12
00:00:34,144 --> 00:00:37,632
verdicts and decision diffs land in a durable ledger.

13
00:00:38,082 --> 00:00:42,229
Today's Operator runs deterministically, with no model turn.

14
00:00:42,229 --> 00:00:44,717
The recorded baseline predates that.

15
00:00:45,167 --> 00:00:49,043
Shared planning tools produce one five-shot firing table.

16
00:00:49,043 --> 00:00:50,471
The server graded it:

17
00:00:50,471 --> 00:00:51,695
five of five hits.

18
00:00:52,145 --> 00:00:55,203
A compressed replay of a development simulation.

19
00:00:55,203 --> 00:00:56,987
The evidence is in the repo.

